OL,3,AAs they return to the UK, Harry and
OL,4,AMeghan search for a brand that sticks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn late July, the Duchess of Sussex's
OL,7,Flifestyle range, called As ever,
OL,8,Flaunched a "rich, vibrant" blackberry
OL,9,Fspread alongside a softly lit video of
OL,10,Fher picking the fruit.
OL,12,FA month later, Meghan and her husband
OL,13,FPrince Harry are returning to live in
OL,14,Fthe UK just as blackberry season ends.
OL,15,FPerhaps we can expect another video
OL,16,Fsoon, shot on these shores.
OL,18,FOr perhaps not, because experts say the
OL,19,FHarry and Meghan brand is at a
OL,20,Fcrossroads.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
